  "decision_conditions": [
    "The development hereby permitted shall be commenced before the expiration of three years from the date of this permission.<br>",
    "<p>The development hereby approved shall only be carried out in accordance with the following approved plans and documents:</p><p>ZAAVIA/122WG/502 - Proposed Plans - 29 May<br>ZAAVIA/122WG/503 - Proposed Plans and Elevations - 29 May<br>ZAAVIA/122WG/505 - Proposed Site Plan - 29 May<br>Location Plan - n.d.</p><p>No other drawings or documents apply.</p>",
    "<p class=\"MsoNormal\">The materials to be used in the construction of the external surfaces of the development hereby permitted shall match those used in the existing dwellinghouse.<br></p>",
    "Prior to first use,&nbsp;a plan&nbsp;indicating&nbsp;the position, design, materials, and type of boundary treatment to be erected&nbsp;shall&nbsp;be&nbsp;submitted&nbsp;to,&nbsp;and approved in writing by,&nbsp;the Local Planning Authority. The development shall not be occupied until the approved boundary treatment has been&nbsp;completed. The approved boundary treatment shall be&nbsp;retained&nbsp;in perpetuity.",
    "The outbuilding hereby permitted shall not be occupied or used at any time other than for purposes ancillary to the residential use of the dwelling known as 122 Wilmington Gardens and as shown on the plans hereby approved.&nbsp;"
  ],
